OL,5,G1455 The Darling Buds of May
OL,6,     FPart one of two. Dispirited by a
OL,7,     Fwet English summer, the Larkins
OL,8,     Fcross the Channel in the hope that
OL,9,     Fthe French way of life will have a
OL,10,     Fbeneficial effect on the family.
OL,11,G1600 The Hotel Inspector
OL,12,     FThe Hotel Inspector travels to
OL,13,     Fvarious hotels to give them advice
OL,14,     Fand suggestions on how to improves
OL,15,     Ftheir business.
OL,16,G1700 Red Rock
